  note "A-11 · What we're worth (questions.md): at the end of 2025, as known 2026-01-15, counting by A-HR5 (worth.tally). The Lazur rate from 2025-07-01 is a hole, so the interest credited 2025-09-30 and 2025-12-31 is: the plain ask is a hole naming it. A partial line can't carry the hole through A-HR5's rounding of the halves (L §5.18), so the second ask pins the rate at 0 %/year to show the rest, which is the key's partial value (awkward)."

